&lt;/h1>&lt;p>&lt;strong>漏洞复现环境：&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;a class="link" href="https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/tree/master/spring/CVE-2025-41242" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
>https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/tree/master/spring/CVE-2025-41242&lt;/a>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>Black Hat Asia 2026议题PPT：&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;a class="link" href="https://i.blackhat.com/Asia-26/Presentations/Asia-26-Bai-Cast-Attack-Ghost-Bits-4.23.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
>https://i.blackhat.com/Asia-26/Presentations/Asia-26-Bai-Cast-Attack-Ghost-Bits-4.23.pdf&lt;/a>&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="原理">原理
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>java中的char类型和byte类型的转换导致的漏洞，char类型是16位，byte是8位，当代码用&lt;code>(byte)ch&lt;/code>、&lt;code>ch &amp;amp; 0xFF&lt;/code>、&lt;code>baos.write(ch)&lt;/code>、&lt;code>DataOutputStream#writeBytes()&lt;/code>这类写法把char强转成byte时，&lt;strong>高8位会被静默丢弃，只保留低8位&lt;/strong>。&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>